# Real DepEd exports used to validate the importers (SF1 / SF8 / SF10 …).
# These hold the names, LRNs, birth dates, health data and parents of real
# minors, and everything under public/ is copied verbatim into the Vite build
# and served publicly. Keep them as local working-copy files only; tests must
# use invented learners and skip when a sample is absent.
public/SF1_*.xls
public/SF1_*.xlsx
public/*_SF10.xls
public/*_SF10.xlsx

